{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54530","headline":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 十七 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丙丁日，若（京本作「前」）遇黑云拦（辛本、川本作「闲」）。\n莫恃兵多兼将勇，也宜坚守（京本作「壁」）引师还。\n征战（京本作「伐」）必遭[残]（殃）（从京本改）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54530.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54530","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}